  "extraction_notes": [
    "This is a p-channel MOSFET. Datasheet negative VDS, VGS, ID, and IS values are represented as positive magnitudes in the extraction while polarity is preserved as p.",
    "The source table gives a typical body-diode voltage of 0.8 V and a maximum of 1.2 V; the schema has one body_diode slot, so the guaranteed maximum is stored and the typical is retained here.",
    "The capacitance table condition applies to Ciss, Coss, and Crss; the Ciss curve is digitized from the typical characteristic plot.",
    "Curve axes follow the datasheet figures, which display p-channel quantities as positive magnitudes."
  ],
